# Stage 13 — Preproduction stage 1 spec

Read `references/epub_assets_figures_tables.md`, `references/chapter_title_policy.md`,
and (for cover/frontmatter) any private_use overlay references if present.

Write `preproduction/stage1/production_spec.md` covering:
- cover plan (producer line: `LifeBook 书坊 译制`, or the private-use producer line
  if `publication_mode=private_use`)
- book-info / frontmatter page plan
- fonts, headings hierarchy, body typography
- figures/tables handling and asset inventory
- OPF metadata (title, author, language={{ target_lang }}, identifier, rights)
- chapter navigation labels (short nav titles per the title policy)

Also write `frontmatter/` pages (e.g. title page, translator note) as needed and
fill `metadata/book.yaml` completely.

Then `set_state` -> `PREPRODUCTION_SPEC_DONE`, step `13_preproduction_stage1_spec`.

Exit condition: `preproduction/stage1/production_spec.md` exists; book.yaml complete.
